<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1965902121"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1633589771"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="きみの横顔"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="麻枝准 / やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="きみの横顔"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:44.999"><div begin="00:28.984" end="05:44.999"><p begin="00:28.984" end="00:35.913" itunes:key="L1">生まれた場所から随分と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离诞生那处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ta ba sho ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:35.914" end="00:42.759" itunes:key="L2">流れ流されて漂着した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被湍流裹挟着漂泊 终于靠了岸</span></p><p begin="00:42.760" end="00:49.630" itunes:key="L3">どろどろになって目眩もする<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑身沾满泥泞 感到一阵目眩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ro do ro ni na 't te me ma i ga su ru</span></p><p begin="00:49.631" end="00:55.501" itunes:key="L4">持ち上げられても逆さまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被迫起身 视线倒转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo chi a ge ra re te mo sa ka sa ma da</span></p><p begin="00:56.017" end="01:02.905" itunes:key="L5">瞳に映るのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">映入眼帘的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to mi ni u tsu ru no ha</span></p><p begin="01:02.906" end="01:09.271" itunes:key="L6">命の遺失物置き場だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是生命的失物招领处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no i shi tsu bu tsu o ki ba da</span></p><p begin="01:14.409" end="01:17.924" itunes:key="L7">時が時が過ぎ去っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任由时间流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ga to ki ga su gi sa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:17.925" end="01:21.358" itunes:key="L8">今を今をただ生き抜く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也只想努力活过当下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wo i ma wo ta da i ki nu ku</span></p><p begin="01:21.359" end="01:24.769" itunes:key="L9">未来には期待はしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾对未来抱有任何期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i ni ha ki ta i ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:24.770" end="01:27.810" itunes:key="L10">いつだって不安で及び腰<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是满心不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te fu a n de o yo bi go shi</span></p><p begin="01:28.087" end="01:31.580" itunes:key="L11">雨が雨が降り続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大雨挥洒不断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ga a me ga fu ri tsu du ke ta</span></p><p begin="01:31.581" end="01:35.018" itunes:key="L12">大地を激しく叩いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨滴拍打地面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i chi wo ha ge shi ku ta ta i ta</span></p><p begin="01:35.019" end="01:38.445" itunes:key="L13">歌がなぜか今聞こえた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何 一阵歌声萦绕耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta ga na ze ka i ma ki ko e ta</span></p><p begin="01:38.446" end="01:41.845" itunes:key="L14">愛を込めた旋律だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是承载爱意的旋律啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i wo ko me ta se n ri tsu da</span></p><p begin="01:42.289" end="01:49.132" itunes:key="L15">頬伝う その涙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水滴落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo tsu ta u so no na mi da</span></p><p begin="01:49.133" end="01:55.548" itunes:key="L16">そっと拭う その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">侧过脸悄然拂去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to nu gu u so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="02:10.141" end="02:17.052" itunes:key="L17">どうせなら構わず捨て置いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正事已至此 不如狠心舍弃吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u se na ra ka ma wa zu su te o i te</span></p><p begin="02:17.053" end="02:23.888" itunes:key="L18">ゆらゆらと揺れる矛と盾<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">左右摇摆的矛盾</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra yu ra to yu re ru ho ko to ta te</span></p><p begin="02:23.889" end="02:30.725" itunes:key="L19">どれだけ洗っても汚れたまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论如何清洗 依旧污秽不堪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do re da ke a ra 't te mo yo go re ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:30.726" end="02:36.713" itunes:key="L20">汗も血も恐怖もないまぜだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晨 鲜血 恐怖 都混杂一同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa mo chi mo kyo u fu mo na i ma ze da</span></p><p begin="02:37.213" end="02:44.018" itunes:key="L21">瞳を切り裂いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">斩裂双眸映出的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to mi wo ki ri sa i te</span></p><p begin="02:44.019" end="02:50.884" itunes:key="L22">背負った深すぎる罪ごと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">背负过分沉重的罪名</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se o 't ta fu ka su gi ru tsu mi go to</span></p><p begin="02:52.163" end="02:55.649" itunes:key="L23">風が風が通り過ぎる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清风拂过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga ka ze ga to o ri su gi ru</span></p><p begin="02:55.650" end="02:59.065" itunes:key="L24">今日が今日が昨日になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天 终会化为昨天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u ga kyo u ga ki no u ni na ru</span></p><p begin="02:59.066" end="03:02.491" itunes:key="L25">早く早く見つけなくちゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要快点找见憧憬才行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ya ku ha ya ku mi tsu ke na ku cha</span></p><p begin="03:02.492" end="03:05.605" itunes:key="L26">無限のような時の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这似是无限的时间中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ge n no yo u na to ki no na ka</span></p><p begin="03:05.843" end="03:09.305" itunes:key="L27">理性も知性も置いてきた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已将理性 知性甩在身后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri se i mo chi se i mo o i te ki ta</span></p><p begin="03:09.306" end="03:12.737" itunes:key="L28">ひとが足で踏みにじった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们痛心践踏如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ga a shi de fu mi ni ji 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:12.738" end="03:16.233" itunes:key="L29">いつのまにかひとりだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知从何时起 我已是孤单一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu no ma ni ka hi to ri da 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:16.234" end="03:19.586" itunes:key="L30">夜と闇が連れ去った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只好与长夜 黑暗作伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru to ya mi ga tsu me sa 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:20.079" end="03:26.950" itunes:key="L31">頬伝う その涙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水滴落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo tsu ta u so no na mi da</span></p><p begin="03:26.951" end="03:33.307" itunes:key="L32">思い出す その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我想起那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da su so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="03:45.716" end="03:48.240" itunes:key="L33">もう泣かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再哭了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u na ka na i</span></p><p begin="03:48.731" end="03:52.110" itunes:key="L34">時が時が過ぎ去っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任由时间流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ga to ki ga su gi sa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:52.111" end="03:55.551" itunes:key="L35">今を今をただ生き抜く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也只想努力活过当下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wo i ma wo ta da i ki nu ku</span></p><p begin="03:55.552" end="03:59.031" itunes:key="L36">未来には期待はしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾对未来抱有任何期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i ni ha ki ta i ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="03:59.032" end="04:02.193" itunes:key="L37">いつだって不安で及び腰<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是满心不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te fu a n de o yo bi go shi</span></p><p begin="04:02.417" end="04:05.891" itunes:key="L38">雨が雨が降り続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大雨挥洒不断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ga a me ga fu ri tsu du ke ta</span></p><p begin="04:05.892" end="04:09.231" itunes:key="L39">雪も雹も叩きつけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨滴拍打地面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ki mo hyo u mo ta ta ki tsu ke ta</span></p><p begin="04:09.232" end="04:12.751" itunes:key="L40">歌がなぜか今聞こえた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何 一阵歌声萦绕耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta ga na ze ka i ma ki ko e ta</span></p><p begin="04:12.752" end="04:16.141" itunes:key="L41">愛を込めた旋律だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是承载爱意的旋律啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i wo ko me ta se n ri tsu da</span></p><p begin="04:16.578" end="04:23.414" itunes:key="L42">頬伝う その涙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水滴落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo tsu ta u so no na mi da</span></p><p begin="04:23.415" end="04:29.852" itunes:key="L43">そっと拭う その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">侧过脸悄然拂去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to nu gu u so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:30.281" end="04:37.119" itunes:key="L44">頬伝う その涙<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水滴落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo tsu ta u so no na mi da</span></p><p begin="04:37.120" end="04:42.681" itunes:key="L45">思い出す その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我想起那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da su so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:43.103" end="04:46.498" itunes:key="L46">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:46.499" end="04:49.942" itunes:key="L47">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:49.943" end="04:53.353" itunes:key="L48">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:53.354" end="04:56.766" itunes:key="L49">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="04:56.767" end="05:00.215" itunes:key="L50">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="05:00.216" end="05:03.679" itunes:key="L51">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="05:03.680" end="05:07.075" itunes:key="L52">その横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那侧脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no yo ko ga o</span></p><p begin="05:07.076" end="05:44.999" itunes:key="L53">失うかも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已然失去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u shi na u ka na</span></p></div></body></tt>